  "home.openTitle": "Open source & multi-hub",
  "home.openBody": "This software is <strong>open source</strong> (LGPL-2.1). Anyone can run their own hub. This site is a public seed — not the only network. If a hub goes down, the live app can try other hubs from a public directory. Helpers run a full chat node you can share.",
